  "description": "High-performance LINQ provider for JSON data that processes JSON directly without full deserialization. Supports standard string, UTF-8, streaming, and advanced streaming JSONPath operations. Dramatically improves performance and memory efficiency for medium to large JSON files through early termination and constant memory usage. Includes native IAsyncEnumerable support and .NET 10 async LINQ integration.",
